# Local development only.
#
# 1. Copy this file to ".secret.local" in this same directory (that filename
#    is gitignored, see .gitignore).
# 2. Replace the placeholder below with your real Gemini API key.
# 3. Run the Functions emulator (`npm run serve`) — it will read this file
#    automatically to provide GEMINI_API_KEY to chatWithGemini.
#
# This file is ONLY for local emulation. It must never be committed, and it
# has no effect on deployed functions — see README notes on
# `firebase functions:secrets:set GEMINI_API_KEY` for production.

GEMINI_API_KEY=PEGAR_AQUI_TU_API_KEY
